1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:02,240
Well, I got to run.
The panel's tomorrow morning.

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:04,700
It's called, "Remembering Snow:
A Look Back."

3
00:00:04,710 --> 00:00:07,410
(Bernadette:)I'll try to catch it.

4
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:08,810
(Glenn:)Oh, great.

5
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:10,380
(Glenn:)Bye.
Bye.

6
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:15,550
(Howard:)Hey... Bernie?

7
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:16,720
(Bernadette:)Yeah?

8
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:20,120
(Howard:)Please tell me he's
your gay cousin.

9
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:22,920
(Sheldon:)No.

10
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,920
(Bernadette:)He was one of my professors
in college.

11
00:00:24,930 --> 00:00:27,730
(Howard:)Oh! That's a relief.

12
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:29,300
(Bernadette:)Then we went out
for a year.

13
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:33,470
(Bernadette:)Come on, let's check in,
so we can take that nap.

14
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:39,140
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)No, it's not necessarily
proportional...

15
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:40,410
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)Shut up!

16
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:48,420
(Howard:)That green bag
is Dr. Cooper's.

17
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:50,340
(Howard:)Here's an extra five.
Make him wait.

18
00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:55,980
(Sheldon:)Oh.

19
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:59,020
(Howard:)Right to the nap, huh? Okay.

